  "uncertainty": "For the requested 2026-10-04 assessment, the supplied FCC evidence identifies CBS Broadcasting Inc. as KPIX-TV's licensee. The dossier does not establish the intervening legal ownership links between that licensee and CBS or Paramount, nor establish Paramount Skydance Corporation as the ultimate parent. The 2021 Wilmerding CBS Holding Company filing describes an attributable interest, which does not by itself establish a parent-subsidiary ownership link. Associated Broadcasters is identified only as a historical owner. The dossier contains no evidence establishing a controlling person, the current chief executive officer of Paramount Skydance Corporation, or an ownership transaction and its status. Scott Warren and Jennifer Mitchell hold other roles and do not satisfy the requested leader definition."
